# Markdown image select-resize

## Context

- Branch: `phase-13-md-image-resize`
- Shared editor: [`client/src/components/shared/MarkdownEditor.tsx`](client/src/components/shared/MarkdownEditor.tsx)
- TipTap Image `resize` updates display `width`/`height` attrs only (not the upload file)
- Custom `renderMarkdown` required so sizes survive Markdown save/reload

## Approach

1. Add [`ResizableMarkdownImage.ts`](client/src/components/shared/ResizableMarkdownImage.ts) — TipTap Image with resize + HTML `<img>` round-trip when sized
2. Wire into MarkdownEditor
3. Style `[data-resize-handle]` in `index.css`

## Out of scope

- Re-encoding upload files
- Edge handles / free distort
- Image Board / canvas UIs
